WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:05.880
So when I start my concert, I like to face
my back towards the audience to build anticipation.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:09.140
So that way they think, 
"Oh no, who's coming on stage?"

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:10.560
It's me.

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:16.860
[singing]

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.380
Oh my God, I'm so excited!

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:21.320
Thanks. I would be too.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:32.120
So whatever negative energy you have within you, 
you gotta let it out.

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:39.760
You can't let anything stand in your way.
'Cause when you sing, it's all about aggression and anger and passion and love and hate.

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:46.500
Let's say Britney or Pink or Lady Caca comes at me, I'm not gonna say,

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.240
[singing] "Come at me, bro."

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:50.400
I'm gonna say,

00:00:50.400 --> 00:01:02.940
[singing] "Come at me BRO!"

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:04.580
Right?

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:07.140
F*** those f***ing bitch f***s!

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:12.280
It's really hard for me to describe these techniques to regular people.

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:13.940
[singing]

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:15.360
That was good!

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:19.140
[singing]

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:21.520
Great! I can see where it will go.

00:01:22.820 --> 00:01:26.500
[singing well]

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:29.200
That was okay.

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:32.040
I'm not threatened by other singers.

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:33.680
I'm not.

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:35.800
[singing]

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:39.340
Maybe it's only something I can do. Like this:

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:44.480
[singing]

00:01:44.480 --> 00:01:45.760
Oh, okay. I get it.

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:49.580
[singing]

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:51.200
Stop. Stop stop.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.400
Come here for a sec.

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:55.300
Oh, honey! Are you okay?

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:58.000
Maybe you should let your voice rest for a
bit.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:00.260
Who's next?

00:02:00.700 --> 00:02:06.460
I said, who's NEXT?

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:10.120
I'm Christina Aguilera, and this is my singing class.

